#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0087 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Every randomized subject (ARMCD populated and not SCRNFAIL/NOTASSGN) carries a populated RFSTDTC; the screen-failure / not-assigned / unassigned subjects may leave it empty -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col RFSTDTC  type=Char label="Subject Reference Start Date/Time"
col ARMCD    type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | 2020-01-15 | A
S1 | DM | 002 |            | SCRNFAIL
S1 | DM | 003 |            | NOTASSGN
S1 | DM | 004 |            |
